post_install() {
  cat <<'MSG'
Meeting Recorder is installed; open it from the launcher.

The first time you open it, it offers to put its widget in the bar
(a live waveform while you record).

Optional, per user:

  A floating window, in ~/.config/hypr (Omarchy Quattro, Lua):
    o.window("^com\\.jankeesvw\\.OmarchyMeetingRecorder$", { float = true })
    o.window("^com\\.jankeesvw\\.OmarchyMeetingRecorder$", { size = { 480, 700 } })
    o.window("^com\\.jankeesvw\\.OmarchyMeetingRecorder$", { center = true })

The speech model (about 1.6 GB) is downloaded on first use, or taken from
voxtype when it already has it.
MSG
}

post_upgrade() {
  :
}
